    columns in a JSON object mapping column names to equal-length lists.

    Non-numeric columns (any column containing a non-numeric value) are
    ignored. Returns a nested dict {col: {col: correlation}}.
    Raises ValueError for invalid JSON, empty data, or mismatched lengths.
