- **Entities:** `convert_charrefs=True` makes the parser deliver `&amp;`, `&#39;`, `&nbsp;`, etc. already decoded in `handle_data`.
- **Malformed HTML:** Unbalanced or missing end tags are tolerated via the stack cleanup in `close()`.

Example:

```python
print(extract_table_rows(
    "<table><tr><th>Name</th></tr><tr><td>Alice</td><td>30</td></tr></table>"
))
# [[], ['Alice', '30']]

print(extract_table_rows(
    "<table><tr><td>a &amp; b</td><td><i>x</i>1</td></tr>"
    "<tr><th>H</th><td>  y  </td></tr></table>"
))
# [['a & b', 'x1'], ['y']]

print(extract_table_rows("<p>no tables here</p>"))
