    """Return the first business day (Mon-Fri) strictly after *date_str*.

    ``date_str`` may be written in any common format, for example
    ``'2022-10-22'``, ``'10/22/2022'``, ``'Oct 22, 2022'`` or
    ``'22 October 2022'``.  The result is an ISO formatted ``YYYY-MM-DD``
    string.
